# Gate B, DiT: noise_x at early / middle / late timesteps x 3 severities on manifest v1.1 (224 images),
# with quality scores. The pilot showed DiT turning from clean to broken between severity 0.25 and 1.0.
#     qsub -P <your-project-id> -l walltime=02:00:00 -v SETTINGS=lanes/p2/jobs/gateb_dit.env lanes/p2/jobs/pilot.pbs
# Estimated from the pilot: 10 runs x ~8 min = ~80 min. Outputs: outputs/p2/gateb/<JOBID>/.
# The manifest is P1's draft v1.1 pending P3 sign-off, copied outside the repo (lanes/p2/README.md, "Gate B").
MANIFEST=outputs/p2/manifest/frozen_v1_1.csv
EXP_TAG=gateb
RUN_VAR=0
RUN_DIT=1
DIT_STAGES="798 497 197"
DIT_SEVERITIES="0.25 0.5 1.0"
QUALITY=1
